              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">The Comitatus must be led by the Army General. Hand weapon, throwing or thrusting spear, light armour and shield. Mounted Comitatus may have heavy armour (+1) and may either have javelins (+1) or exchange spear and shield for kontos and buckler (free). Mounted Comitatus are Shock Cavalry.</characteristic>
