              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Elite Warriors have hand weapon, light armour, thrusting or throwing Spear and shield. May have javelins (+1) and may be Riding Horses (+1).</characteristic>
